silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_01_sections_04_concrete_anchor_1#stagezerocatanchor silm:hasLongDescription "The StageZeroCatAnchor is the seed stage; concretely the CatAnchor type node alone. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'D_Mittens^0', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
